@title Q4 ticket triage: 30 tickets into Now / Next / Later / Cut
@subtitle Harbor invoicing, ENG board, proposed ordering for the last six weeks of the quarter
@author Claude, Engineering planning
@date 2026-10-19
@width wide

! This page is a static snapshot, not an editor. The proposed buckets are pre-filled below. To change one, move the ticket line in the export block at the bottom and paste that block back.

## The proposal in numbers

kpi Now | 7 tickets | 24 pts | neutral
kpi Next | 9 tickets | 50 pts | neutral
kpi Later | 8 tickets | 92 pts | neutral
kpi Cut | 6 tickets | 65 pts | bad

data load = bucket,tickets,points; Now,7,24; Next,9,50; Later,8,92; Cut,6,65
chart bar load y=points labels title="Estimated points per bucket"

Team velocity is about 32 pts per two-week sprint, so Now fits the first sprint with 8 pts of slack for interrupts. Now plus Next (74 pts) fills the quarter at about 2.3 sprints.

