## Now

Customer-facing money bugs, security, and the EU VAT deadline. Everything here has a date or an active complaint behind it.

table now heat=impact

## Next

Revenue and retention work that starts as soon as Now clears. Order within the table is the suggested pick-up order.

table next heat=impact

## Later

Valuable or strategic, but large or waiting on a decision. Revisit at Q1 planning.

table later

## Cut

Close these with a short comment. None has a customer, a deadline, or usage data behind it.

table cut

## Calls worth a second look

table = ticket,placed,alternative,what would flip it; ENG-2090 SAML SSO,Next,Now,Both deals sign before Dec 15 and need SAML in the contract; ENG-2086 credit note rounding,Next,Now,Finance says the monthly manual fix is more than 2 hours; ENG-2092 date-fns,Next,Cut,No bundle-size goal is set this quarter; ENG-2107 Temporal,Later,Cut,Job volume stays flat through Q2

## Export: paste this back

Final ordering as Markdown, one rationale line per bucket, tickets in pick-up order.

```md
## Now (7 tickets, 24 pts)
_Customer-facing money bugs, security, and the 2026-11-30 EU VAT deadline; fits one sprint with slack._
1. ENG-2047 Rotate Stripe webhook signing secret (2 pts, Marcus)
2. ENG-2041 Fix duplicate invoice emails on retry (3 pts, Priya)
3. ENG-2070 Rate-limit the login endpoint (2 pts, Lena)
4. ENG-2058 Raise Postgres connection pool ceiling (1 pt, Marcus)
5. ENG-2052 Invoice PDF renders blank on Safari 17 (3 pts, Lena)
6. ENG-2066 CSV export times out above 50k rows (5 pts, Jonas)
7. ENG-2063 Tax ID validation for EU customers (8 pts, Priya)

## Next (9 tickets, 50 pts)
_Revenue and retention work that unblocks sales and activation once Now clears._
1. ENG-2090 SAML SSO for the Team plan (13 pts, Tomas)
2. ENG-2075 Recurring invoice scheduler UI (8 pts, Aiko)
3. ENG-2079 Bulk-send reminders for overdue invoices (5 pts, Aiko)
4. ENG-2086 Multi-currency rounding mismatch on credit notes (3 pts, Priya)
5. ENG-2101 Onboarding checklist v2 (5 pts, Aiko)
6. ENG-2083 Audit log for permission changes (5 pts, Tomas)
7. ENG-2095 Webhook delivery retries dashboard (5 pts, Marcus)
8. ENG-2098 Portal: download all invoices as ZIP (3 pts, Lena)
9. ENG-2092 Replace moment.js with date-fns (3 pts, Jonas)

## Later (8 tickets, 92 pts)
_Valuable or strategic but large or waiting on a decision; revisit at Q1 planning._
- ENG-2125 Usage-based billing prototype (21 pts)
- ENG-2110 Quote-to-invoice conversion (13 pts)
- ENG-2116 Localize the UI into German and French (13 pts)
- ENG-2119 Public API v2 cursor pagination (8 pts)
- ENG-2122 Accessibility pass on the invoice editor (8 pts)
- ENG-2107 Migrate Sidekiq jobs to Temporal (21 pts)
- ENG-2104 Dark mode for the customer portal (5 pts)
- ENG-2113 Slack notification when an invoice is paid (3 pts)

## Cut (6 tickets, 65 pts)
_No customer, deadline, or usage data behind them; close with a comment._
- ENG-2134 Rewrite the PDF engine in Rust (34 pts)
- ENG-2128 Gantt view of payment timelines (13 pts)
- ENG-2143 Blockchain payment rail spike (8 pts)
